{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"She then takes off the ring from her right hand and places it next to him saying \n\n\"A memory from me to take with you. You gave this to me, because it is both of this land and of another's just like you... and me. Take this as an offering to the Raven Queen should you meet her.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T04:35:18.792000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743326797181091930","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
